    text: |
      CH12
- elementId: title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 30, 1000, 45]
  content:
    fontSize: 32
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <p><strong>ODRP — 内容摘要</strong></p>
- elementId: title-line
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 78, 120, 3]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: ev-badge-bg
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [1080, 30, 140, 22]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $accent
- elementId: ev-badge-text
  elementType: text
  bounds: [1080, 30, 140, 22]
  content:
    fontSize: 12
    color: #FFFFFF
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.0
    align: [center, middle]
    wrap: False
    text: |
      E1 / Peer-reviewed
- elementId: body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 90, 1160, 560]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <p><strong>核心贡献：</strong>把 remote paging 的内存管理搬进 RNIC data path，而不是只用 RDMA 加速数据搬运。</p>
      <p>传统 one-sided RDMA 适合读写远端 buffer，但不擅长动态 memory allocation/deallocation。</p>
      <p>ODRP 用 RDMA WR chain 在 RNIC 上实现 load、mapped store、unmapped store、invalidate 等 frontswap API，实现 page granularity remote memory management、zero MNode CPU usage。</p>
- elementId: source
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
  content:
    fontSize: 14
    color: $secondary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.2
    wrap: True
    text: |
      来源：ODRP (ASPLOS 2025)｜证据等级：E1 / Peer-reviewed
- elementId: bottom-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
